- Event-driven Lambda triggered by S3
- JSON schema validation in Lambda
- Amazon Comprehend: sentiment and entity detection
- S3 write of analysis artifacts
- DynamoDB upsert for indexing
- IAM least-privilege principles and KMS encryption
- Basic error handling with DLQ and monitoring

